    <guid isPermaLink="false">6af3e78814d01a26f8a8241d</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 04:00:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a>｜开场：两场比赛，两种命运</span></p><p><span>【大蜀道】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a>｜账面数据：91.6公里也叫百公里？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a>｜领物全程无纸化 但 领物、起点相距20公里</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1920">32:00</a>｜夜赛初体验：像熬了个通班</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1920">32:00</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2160">36:00</a>｜补给:大窝窝头 与 辣嗓子的电解质水</span><br></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuCQEFxmndCah4hSX29iFP-HZvkG.jpg"><p><span>【环四姑娘山】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2160">36:00</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a>｜交通 与 领物规则</span></p><p><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2640">44:00</a>｜赛道：45公里起点3800，CP3到CP4最要命</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2640">44:00</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a>｜出师不利 : 5公里摔在木栈道</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3120">52:00</a>｜赛事服务与保险：好评</span><br></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmqpc3WAsXvznN_s-ByVkFyMZlP4.jpg"><p><span>【大蜀道】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3120">52:00</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3360">56:00</a>｜为什么就非得夜跑</span></p><p><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3360">56:00</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3720">62:00</a>｜当跑了一整夜之后还会发生什么</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3720">62:00</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3840">64:00</a>｜换装包还能排大队？</span><br></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FscSNUm0iRta2VTQ9B9g9ur5DJ5D.jpg"><p><span>【环四姑娘山】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3840">64:00</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4200">70:00</a>｜高反经验与推荐态度</span><br><br></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhOM5fya4hy1l_vQHqku8YruAtlg.jpg"><p></p>]]></description>
