  <item>
    <title>EP108:十年九届，西马从第一届就让你着迷</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6acf1a2be742e36efcc2c1fc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6acf1a2be742e36efcc2c1fc</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 06:10:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>西马第十年，第九届。</span></p><p><span>一个拿着终身号90288，一个2022年才开始跑步。</span></p><p><span>首届西马终点为什么铺红地毯？终点拱门为什么正对丹凤门？后来这条“白月光”赛道，为什么被换掉了？</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuAHh_fGHz93-FfrmnStcoW6ie4Q.jpg"><p><span>2020年赛道为什么改到曲江池？2021年配速员为什么要盲测10公里？2024年贾俄仁加在奥体中心最后300米绝杀，现场到底有多炸？</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpj8RznpuwJGWxAm6pwuh0IPlhlC.jpg"><p><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> – <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">05:30</a> | 我有西马终身号，你猜我从第几届开始跑的？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">05:30</a> – <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> | 2017年之前，陕西唯一一场马拉松竟然在杨凌？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> – <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> | 首届西马路线有多绝？大明宫还能铺红地毯？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> – <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a> | 曲江“搓板路”有多难跑？我却在这跑出人生首个4小时</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a> – <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a> | 首届西马就有候补机制？跑西马还能免费逛海洋馆？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a> – <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3420">57:00</a> | 2022年西马唯一一次缺席，那年我才开始跑步</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3420">57:00</a> – <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3720">1:02:00</a> | 新赛道被吐槽“没西安味”，为什么大家却都在这跑PB？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3720">1:02:00</a> – <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3840">1:04:00</a> | 大头在终点亲眼见证，贾俄仁加在奥体最后300米绝杀</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3840">1:04:00</a> – <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3960">1:06:00</a> | 来西安跑马别只知道羊肉泡馍，陕历博这个特展别错过</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpc-2hF6QD-JfRVOK0zf_Vz6YQ6G.jpg"><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6697cbecf103d7b06d18488b/lgzZ0wN3Egl9pybeytLpmGPprkNU.m4a" length="64803512" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:06:47</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi2maFnvlkH3W5WgBey_1Uhc0yUS.jpg"/>
