  <item>
    <title>EP106:龙脊梯田50公里，大头为什么退赛了？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6abcc983195d838e2aec028d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6abcc983195d838e2aec028d</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 08:40:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> — <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> | 龙脊梯田越野赛大头退赛了？赛前肠炎发烧，为啥还上了赛道？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> — <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> | 拉肚子为啥会虚？聊聊电解质流失</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> — <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> | 龙脊梯田值不值得去？交通、住宿、吃饭全是槽点</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> — <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">34:00</a> | 比赛难不难？50公里3200爬升，开头像高速赛道？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">34:00</a> — <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a> | CP1到CP2有多虐？连续1000+爬升，大头道心破碎</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a> — <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3240">54:00</a> | 梯田、草甸、密林，爬到最后为啥绝望？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3240">54:00</a> — <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4020">67:00</a> | 下坡摔跤、竹刺受伤、危险路段堵车，顺便聊聊越野礼仪</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4020">67:00</a> — <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4320">72:00</a> | 夜跑可怕吗？满月、头灯，还有纸巾老师冲线啥心情</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4320">72:00</a> — <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4800">80:00</a> | 所以推荐吗？风景值，但交通和接待得先想清楚</span></p><p></p><p></p><p><span>keep超跑节报名方式：小程序搜索：「Keep报名」 即可</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi7BCIXDAK_GKwXSAwkiEVLcn7Bd.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgdCzb-LCrydepRANo1BsIQT_s33.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnwjJ1wqCSGWoowrfLcBrS03fOH5.jpg"><p></p>]]></description>
