    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ab35aedf04646b3a955cf3e</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 04:55:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a> | 赵家驹330公里、24000米爬升，这比赛到底多变态？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a> | 65小时55分22秒，破纪录夺冠</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> | 规则怪谈：禁私补、禁陪跑、禁抄近路</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> | 30小时只睡20分钟，他后程还能反超</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a> | 真正的难点：困到恍惚，还要守住底线</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a> | 什么叫巨人：绝境里不偷懒、不侥幸</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a> | “人类没有极限”和“外卖小哥”叙事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3120">52:00</a> | 巨人身后还有巨人：妻子亚薇</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3120">52:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3360">56:00</a> | 普通人要不要跑330？做自己的巨人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3360">56:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3840">64:00</a> | 关于纸巾的比赛小预告</span></p>]]></description>
