  <item>
    <title>EP104:真实徒步经历：她跟着&quot;狠人&quot;爬山，一路都不知道要去哪</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6aaa2a3d9d3264778169ef35</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6aaa2a3d9d3264778169ef35</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 05:39:23 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目是纸巾和他的爱人@阿布在户外 于年初录制的一期有关她某次徒步经历的内容。</span></p><p><span>这样的的分享在社交媒体上不多见，因为大多数人只分享了路上出的片又或者是冷酷的数据，也因为很少有这么长的视频让人如此细致地展开。</span></p><p><span>如果你对爬山和徒步感兴趣，欢迎收听，也欢迎你分享你独特的徒步经历。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">03:30</a>｜原计划封山了：他说“没事，我有Plan B”可怕的是——他的备用计划，我完全不知道。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">03:30</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">07:00</a>｜“我们到底去哪？”——一路只有一句话：到时候看。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">07:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a>｜最折磨人的不是累，而是根本不知道终点在哪。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="930">15:30</a>｜快到营地时，他突然说：水源没了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="930">15:30</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a>｜他说：去那边找水 在完全不确定的情况下，我们又走了两公里。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1350">22:30</a>｜看到牦牛喝水的那一刻，我终于放心了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1350">22:30</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a>｜4200米出发：我以为自己还能行</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1740">29:00</a>｜“这个能不能算山顶？”他说：爬山这件事，你爬就对了，别老想着顶在哪。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1740">29:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1920">32:00</a>｜体力耗尽以后，人真的会开始说胡话</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1920">32:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2130">35:30</a>｜情绪价值没用了，他直接把两个包都背上了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2130">35:30</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2340">39:00</a>｜一个不到30岁的人，为什么可以这么松弛？他为什么好像永远都不慌？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2340">39:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2520">42:00</a>｜面对未知，我们真的能做到从容吗？</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fta6U26MSBRmUa5UCrR5uLrUqPKh.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn_nmxJUAbHQW7GExdR26Z1AZ9N3.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn5DQZCVfEjLlfQAIHhUAB9tL5O9.png"><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6697cbecf103d7b06d18488b/li4m5G-yPsT2YEbj2EVxOjO0TSyo.m4a" length="44424685" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:45:46</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi2maFnvlkH3W5WgBey_1Uhc0yUS.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP103:UTMB私补员30小时奔波，只换你10分钟进站</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6aa0e6d630dee5c2474b8fa1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6aa0e6d630dee5c2474b8fa1</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 05:00:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p></p><p><span>本期节目，第三次冲击100公里失败的纸巾老师回归节目，同时我们邀请到了《越野越有趣》的两位主播Allie&amp;大心串台，加上陕西的越野精英，TNF签约运动员王继骞（一郎）一起聊了聊刚刚结束的UTMB。</span></p><p><span>Allie很享受的完成了她的CCC 一郎则是以中国选手第二名的成绩完成了UTMB 最让人感动的还是大心 她在这场比赛中为丈夫一郎完成了私补工作</span></p><p><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a></span></u><span> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="270">04:30</a>｜退了！东北100到底有多难？</span></p><p><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="270">04:30</a></span></u><span> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a>｜普通人，凭什么挑战100公里？</span></p><p><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a></span></u><span> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a>｜第一次跑UTMB，真的能跑完吗？</span></p><p><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a></span></u><span> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a>｜AI算成绩，居然算准了？</span></p><p><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a></span></u><span> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a>｜为什么这次跑完，竟然“不痛苦”？</span></p><p><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a></span></u><span> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1920">32:00</a>｜跑168公里，为什么还要带个“私补”？</span></p><p><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1920">32:00</a></span></u><span> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a>｜私补，为什么比运动员还紧张？</span></p><p><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a></span></u><span> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2640">44:00</a>｜30斤东西，只为见面10分钟？</span></p><p><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2640">44:00</a></span></u><span> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2940">49:00</a>｜运动员失联了，私补有多崩溃？</span></p><p><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2940">49:00</a></span></u><span> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3240">54:00</a>｜去年退赛的地方，今年敢再来一次吗？</span></p><p><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3240">54:00</a></span></u><span> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3540">59:00</a>｜23小时15分，到底是什么水平？</span></p><p><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3540">59:00</a></span></u><span> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3900">1:05:00</a>｜中国越野，真的被海外选手拉开了？</span></p><p><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3900">1:05:00</a></span></u><span> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4140">1:09:00</a>｜为什么欧洲人跑越野这么快？</span></p><p><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4140">1:09:00</a></span></u><span> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4320">1:12:00</a>｜国内精英，为什么被迫疯狂参赛？</span></p><p><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4320">1:12:00</a></span></u><span> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4440">1:14:00</a>｜跑到最后，我们到底在追什么？</span></p><p></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiPlqXeAwbIOgFwWQnSqbyRIsjQ8.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm76B7KaVAwXXXA02zVLeNg23_DJ.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs79cO_7o0mPx21npK5LMneofO-f.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh0iMhn6HQAbv0Hm5gYntZKzLpOL.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ftdr44REirP_R7P7jwYE1tnCoPKM.jpg"><p></p>]]></description>
